# Connect with the Computer Science and AI Community

Connecting with the computer science and AI community is can help students see the real world relevance of computer science and AI and consider how they fit into the broader computer science and AI community. It is also important for teachers to connect with other computer science and AI educators in order to learn and grow as professionals. 

### **In this lesson, you will:**

* Learn about opportunities to connect with the broader computer science and AI community.
<br>

**Suggested time:** 10 minutes

